From 1964dbb4c99ade509b6a6f669b2bc83ad617252b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wenhao Chai <reselfchai@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 21:06:54 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] --megatron-hf-checkpoint: the Megatron side reads its own
 HF checkpoint

Bridge model build, HF weight load (actor --load fallback, critic), weight export to sglang,
save_hf and hf_config read --megatron-hf-checkpoint (default --hf-checkpoint); sglang and the
tokenizer keep --hf-checkpoint. Lets text-only RL train a Qwen3_5ForCausalLM (GPTModel, no
vision tower) while sglang serves Qwen3_5ForConditionalGeneration with language_model_only;
the exported model.layers.* names load into it unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YBcVrDE1HspU5PgJLmxVZp
